causeTitle.format:
IN THE COURT OF {courtDesignation}

{caseNomenclature}

IN THE MATTER OF:
{applicant} ... Applicant/Accused

prayerTemplate:
PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above, the applicant having surrendered himself before this Hon'ble Court of his own volition, it is most respectfully prayed that this Hon'ble Court may graciously be pleased to:

a) Take cognizance of the surrender of the applicant {applicant} in connection with FIR No. {fir_number} dated {fir_date} of Police Station {police_station};
b) Pass appropriate order regarding custody / remand / release of the applicant in accordance with law;
c) Direct the Investigating Officer concerned to be informed of the surrender;
d) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper in the interest of justice.

And for this act of kindness, the applicant shall ever pray.
